<title>FRANCE: FRANCE SELLS 315 MLN ECU 2007 OATS AT AUCTION.</title>
<headline>FRANCE SELLS 315 MLN ECU 2007 OATS AT AUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury sold the following government bonds (OATs) at auction on Thursday.</p>
<p> MATURITY	COUPON	SALE AMOUNT     AVERAGE YIELD</p>
<p> 25.APR.07	5.50	  315 MLN	   5.98</p>
<p> BID AMT/COVER    NON-COMPETITIVE BIDS   LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE</p>
<p> 1.235 BLN/3.9		   NIL		 96.48</p>
<p> PCT ALLOTED AT LOWEST PRICE*		  PAYMENT DATE</p>
<p> 100.0						   14.AUG</p>
<p> * PRICES ABOVE GOT ALLOTMENTS IN FULL     NEXT AUCTION</p>
<p>							   04.SEP</p>
<p>NOTE - The Treasury originally announced it would sell 300 to 500 Million Ecus of OATs in total.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
